    "pages": [
      {
        "number": 1,
        "text": "Butternut Pesto Noodles\nServes 2\n\nIngredients\n200 g egg noodles\n1 small butternut squash, peeled and diced\n2 tbsp olive oil\n200 ml coconut milk\n3 tbsp basil pesto\n1 tsp Worcestershire sauce\n20 g butter\n30 g Parmesan, grated\nSalt and pepper to taste\n\nMethod\n1. Preheat the oven to 200°C. Toss the squash with the olive oil and roast for 25 minutes.\n2. Cook the egg noodles in salted water until tender, then drain.\n3. Melt the butter in a large pan, add the coconut milk, pesto and Worcestershire sauce and simmer for 3 minutes.\n4. Add the roasted squash and the noodles to the pan and stir to coat.\n5. Serve with the Parmesan on top.",
        "method": "plain_text",
        "decoration_text": [],
        "uncertain": [],
        "usage": null
      }
    ]
